* When parsing, change the XNode tree to be a flat array
    This will allow us to create a `Defered` tag that only needs to store an index into the array to know where to continue from
    The XNode will need to know when to branch and unbranch

* Resouce for tracking id'd nodes

* Observing Template Properties
    * When a property changes I need the following:
        * TemplateProperties

    * TemplateProperties should be updated
        Add fields
            * Subscribers: HashMap<String, Subscriber>
                A Hash of entities that are subscribed to events
                The key should be the field name that is being changed: 'text', 'display', etc....
                Subscriber should include
                    * Entity: Entity
                        Entity that is subscribing to the event
                    * TemplateNodeIndex: number
                        What index into the HtmlTemplate XNode array this entity originated from
        Add functions
            * update<T>(key: impl Into<String>, T: value, cmd: &mut Commands)
                * update the underlying HashMap to have the new value
                * Check if there are subscribers to this key
                    * Look up the Subscribers for that property
                    * For each Subscriber
                        * Look up the XNode from the HtmlTemplate
                        * Reprocess the value
                        * Look up the trigger type
                        * trigger the observer